\\n\\n- Fix money rounding to use ROUND_HALF_EVEN (banker's rounding), per FIN-212.\\n\"}]}", "call_id": "call_0xJ7Vsn72YhqKLs0S3gcwP0n", "name": "commit_changes", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_03f4d87f90d0d286006ad25b6435c087d09219a00cdb8ca847", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}, {"response_id": "resp_03f4d87f90d0d286006ad25b693bb887d0bd51eb5008bbd958", "status": "completed", "output": [{"arguments": "{\"ref\":\"de167b1a1a\",\"idempotency_key\":\"fin-212-half-even-de167b1a1a\"}", "call_id": "call_FwQ5Vn2Xl0l6QSJy397DCnRn", "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_03f4d87f90d0d286006ad25b6aa6e087d0a20f2c471953d337", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}, {"response_id": "resp_03f4d87f90d0d286006ad25b6bdbc487d0bf2603320991641c", "status": "completed", "output": [{"arguments": "{\"run_id\":\"ci-0001\",\"max_wait_s\":900}", "call_id": "call_cYWR0xj5CYXuFGbmERAZaUw9", "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_03f4d87f90d0d286006ad25b6d1b8c87d0b24fd244d951ade3", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}, {"response_id": "resp_03f4d87f90d0d286006ad25b6dd89487d0a773e26b63338afc", "status": "completed", "output": [{"arguments": "{\"head\":\"fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding\",\"base\":\"main\",\"title\":\"Fix FIN-212 banker's rounding for money\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n- Use ROUND_HALF_EVEN instead of ROUND_HALF_UP when rounding money to cents, as required by FIN-212.\\n- Retain the existing positive half-even regression test and add negative tie, non-tie, and exact-cent coverage.\\n- Record the fix in the changelog.\\n\\n## Validation\\n- CI ci-0001 passed for commit de167b1a1a.\\n\\n## Release / approval\\nRequested for today's release. Code-owner approval is required before merging into main.\",\"reviewers\":[\"code-owner\"],\"idempotency_key\":\"fin-212-half-even-pr-de167b1a1a\"}", "call_id": "call_09Wb24w4gT6jT2N6Af0SgFST"